
  Error: `tab_color = ...` — assignments aren't allowed inside `layout`, `each`, or `if` UI blocks. UI blocks render; they don't reassign state.

  For per-element values inside an `each`, use a function:

    color_for(item):
      if item is selected:
        return brand
      return subtle

    each item in items:
      label item, color: color_for(item)

  Or compute the value at screen scope (above the layout block) and read it inline.

